{"seq":2,"slug":"gamified-interaction","title":"抽奖与互动小游戏接入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/loyalty-gamification-growth/growth-level/gamified-interaction","wordCount":2856,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"抽奖与互动小游戏接入\">抽奖与互动小游戏接入</h1><p>前一篇讲的等级反馈以「月」为单位，签到以「天」为单位（见 <a href=\"../task-checkin-system/daily-checkin\">签到、连续签到与补签</a>），而抽奖的反馈以「秒」为单位——用户点一下，立刻知道结果，多巴胺在点击后的 200 毫秒内到达。这种即时性让抽奖成为增长玩法里转化率最高的组件之一，也让它成为最容易被攻击的组件：奖池是真实价值，而攻击者的成本只是几百个账号的注册时间，相应的对抗手段见 <a href=\"../anti-abuse-measure/growth-abuse-detection\">刷任务与小号识别</a>。</p>\n<p>这一篇讲的是抽奖与互动小游戏在工程上的三个核心问题：<strong>奖池必须被建模成有限库存</strong>、<strong>抽奖与发奖必须分离</strong>、以及<strong>概率公示与实际概率必须同源</strong>。至于玩法趣味性、动画体验、文案设计属于产品设计范畴，本文不展开。奖励的发放契约与库存扣减的通用机制见 <a href=\"reward-grant-rule\">玩法奖励发放规则与库存</a>，本篇只讲抽奖特有的部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-奖池是有限资源-抽奖是一次原子递减\">核心概念：奖池是有限资源，抽奖是一次原子递减</h2><p>「生成一个 0 到 1 的随机数，落在哪个区间就发对应奖品」是一个可行的实现——只要所有奖品都是无限的。一旦出现「前 1000 名必得」，抽奖的核心操作就变成了<strong>在同一个原子操作里完成「判定中奖」与「扣减库存」</strong>。这与秒杀的库存扣减是同构的，因此它应当复用同一套预扣与幂等基础设施，而不是另起一套随机发奖逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>prize</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Pr(\\text{prize}_i) = \\frac{w_i \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[n_i &gt; 0]}{\\sum_{j} w_j \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[n_j &gt; 0]}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">Pr</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">prize</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5488em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是奖品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的权重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是它剩余库存。指示函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{1}[n_i &gt; 0]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 的关键作用是<strong>在库存耗尽时把该奖品从概率空间中移除并重新归一化</strong>。如果实现成「库存为 0 时该奖品的概率变成未中奖」，那么实际中奖率会低于设计值，而实际中奖率是运营最关心的指标——它直接决定活动成本和用户感受。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>奖池结构</th>\n<th>能表达</th>\n<th>不能表达</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定权重列表</td>\n<td>各奖品相对概率</td>\n<td>数量限制、保底</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权重 + 库存约束</td>\n<td>上述 + 限量</td>\n<td>保底、分层</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权重 + 库存 + 保底层</td>\n<td>上述 + 必中机制</td>\n<td>人群差异化</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权重 + 库存 + 保底 + 人群分层</td>\n<td>上述 + 新老客差异</td>\n<td>跨奖池联动</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整奖品目录 + 规则引擎驱动</td>\n<td>全部，含跨玩法联动</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>很高（多数场景不需要）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行提醒一个常见的过度设计：把抽奖做成一个通用规则引擎驱动的系统，会让运营看不懂奖池，也会让概率公示无法自动生成。奖池的结构化程度应当与运营实际的表达需求匹配，多出的表达能力是负债。</p>\n<h2 id=\"保底机制-一个独立的判定层\">保底机制：一个独立的判定层</h2><p>保底（连续 N 次未中奖必得）在实现上不是权重的一部分，而是一个<strong>前置判定层</strong>：抽奖前先检查用户的连续未中奖次数，达到阈值则直接走保底奖池，否则走常规加权随机。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>draw</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>guaranteed_pool</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>weighted_random</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{draw}(u) = \\begin{cases} \\text{guaranteed\\_pool}, &amp; c_u \\ge K \\\\ \\text{weighted\\_random}(P), &amp; c_u &lt; K \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">draw</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">guaranteed_pool</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">weighted_random</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是用户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 的连续未中奖次数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 是保底阈值。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>用户维度的持久状态</strong>，它的更新必须与抽奖原子进行：并发的两次抽奖不能让两次都读到「已达到阈值」，否则会发出两份保底奖。做法是用原子递增读取（<code>INCR</code> 返回新值后判断）而不是「先读再写」。Redis 文档给出的并发模式正是「自增并读取返回值」：<code>INCR</code> 返回自增后的新值，因此判断与递增不会被其他客户端穿插（来源：Redis INCR 命令文档, <a href=\"https://redis.io/docs/latest/commands/incr/）。\">https://redis.io/docs/latest/commands/incr/）。</a></p>\n<p>保底状态的重置时机同样是设计决策：命中保底后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 归零，但命中普通奖品是否也归零？两种设计都合理——「任意中奖即归零」让保底成为「防连续不中」的体验保护；「仅保底中奖才归零」让保底成为「N 次必得」的确定承诺。对用户而言后者的可预期性更强，对成本控制而言前者更省。选择必须在文档里明确写出，否则运营与工程会对同一个活动的成本产生不同预期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抽奖与发奖的分离\">抽奖与发奖的分离</h2><p>用户点击抽奖后，系统要完成两件事：决定他中了什么，把奖品交付给他。这两件事的成功率相差一个数量级——决定中奖是内部计算，成功率接近 100%；交付奖品要调用券系统、积分账户或第三方卡券平台，后者可能超时或失败。</p>\n<p>如果两者耦合在一个同步流程里，一次外部抖动会让用户看到「抽奖失败」，而他实际上已经消耗了一次抽奖机会。正确形态是<strong>同步定资格与结果、异步保交付</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>lottery</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>consume</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mtext>draw</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>pool</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><msub><mtext>deliver</mtext><mtext>async</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>prize</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{lottery}(u,a) = \\text{consume}(u,a) \\wedge \\text{draw}(a.\\text{pool}) \\wedge \\text{deliver}_{\\text{async}}(\\text{prize}, u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lottery</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">consume</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">draw</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pool</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">deliver</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">async</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">prize</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>一致性要求</th>\n<th>同步/异步</th>\n<th>失败处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>资格与次数校验</td>\n<td>强（防重复参与）</td>\n<td>同步</td>\n<td>拒绝并说明原因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消耗抽奖机会</td>\n<td>强（原子递减）</td>\n<td>同步</td>\n<td>拒绝，不消耗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抽取奖品（含库存递减）</td>\n<td>强（原子）</td>\n<td>同步</td>\n<td>降级为安慰奖或重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奖品交付</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>异步</td>\n<td>进入待补发清单重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果通知</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>异步</td>\n<td>重试 + 消息中心兜底</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本归集</td>\n<td>强（日终）</td>\n<td>批量</td>\n<td>差异登记与对账</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>交付失败的兜底是一张<strong>待补发清单</strong>：交付失败的记录进入清单，后台任务重试直到成功，重试耗尽后转人工。这张清单与整体发奖管道的补发机制是同一个组件，见 <a href=\"reward-grant-rule\">玩法奖励发放规则与库存</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户点击抽奖] --&gt; B[校验资格与剩余次数]&#10;    B --&gt;|不通过| Z[拒绝并提示]&#10;    B --&gt;|通过| C[原子消耗机会]&#10;    C --&gt; D[读取保底计数器 c_u]&#10;    D --&gt; E{c_u &gt;= K ?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[走保底奖池]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[加权随机 + 库存原子递减]&#10;    F --&gt; H[写入中奖记录]&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[同步返回结果给用户]&#10;    H --&gt; J[异步交付奖品]&#10;    J --&gt;|成功| K[标记已交付]&#10;    J --&gt;|失败| L[进入待补发清单]\">graph TD\n    A[用户点击抽奖] --&gt; B[校验资格与剩余次数]\n    B --&gt;|不通过| Z[拒绝并提示]\n    B --&gt;|通过| C[原子消耗机会]\n    C --&gt; D[读取保底计数器 c_u]\n    D --&gt; E{c_u &gt;= K ?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[走保底奖池]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[加权随机 + 库存原子递减]\n    F --&gt; H[写入中奖记录]\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[同步返回结果给用户]\n    H --&gt; J[异步交付奖品]\n    J --&gt;|成功| K[标记已交付]\n    J --&gt;|失败| L[进入待补发清单]</pre><h2 id=\"互动小游戏的接入形态\">互动小游戏的接入形态</h2><p>除了抽奖，常见的互动小游戏有养成类（浇水、喂宠物，长期投入换奖励）、答题类（知识问答赢积分）、以及轻竞技类（排行榜、PK）。它们的工程共性有三条。</p>\n<p><strong>状态在服务端，时长由服务端判定</strong>。养成类的「浇水」如果没有服务端冷却校验，客户端可以连续提交 100 次浇水请求；答题类的计时如果由客户端上报，用户可以无限思考。所有游戏的<strong>节奏参数</strong>（冷却时间、每题时限、每日次数）必须由服务端计算与校验，客户端只负责展示。</p>\n<p><strong>收益必须落到统一奖励目录</strong>。小游戏的产出（积分、道具、券）不能让游戏模块自己发放，否则成本无法归集、防刷无法统一拦截、库存无法跨玩法共享。游戏只声明「产出什么奖励引用」，实际发放走统一管道。</p>\n<p><strong>排行榜是独立的一致性域</strong>。排行榜通常用 Redis 的有序集合（ZSET）实现——ZSET 按 score 升序维护成员，<code>ZADD</code> 精确表达「写入某用户的新分数」且复杂度为 O(log(N))，<code>ZRANGE</code> 按名次范围读取（来源：Redis ZADD 命令文档, <a href=\"https://redis.io/docs/latest/commands/zadd/）。它的读放大极高、写频繁、且允许最终一致（用户接受「榜上名次晚几秒更新」）。不要把排行榜分数与奖励结算耦合在同一个事务里——结算应当基于一份**冻结的最终榜单快照**，而不是实时读取的排行榜，否则在结算瞬间的名次抖动会导致奖励与用户看到的榜单不一致。这与大促秒杀结算基于冻结快照的思路一致，可参考兄弟\">https://redis.io/docs/latest/commands/zadd/）。它的读放大极高、写频繁、且允许最终一致（用户接受「榜上名次晚几秒更新」）。不要把排行榜分数与奖励结算耦合在同一个事务里——结算应当基于一份**冻结的最终榜单快照**，而不是实时读取的排行榜，否则在结算瞬间的名次抖动会导致奖励与用户看到的榜单不一致。这与大促秒杀结算基于冻结快照的思路一致，可参考兄弟</a> hub <code>32_marketing-campaign-platform</code> 中关于秒杀结算的讨论。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>小游戏类型</th>\n<th>核心状态</th>\n<th>一致性要求</th>\n<th>主要作弊面</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>养成类（浇水/喂宠）</td>\n<td>服务端冷却 + 成长阶段</td>\n<td>强（防脚本连点）</td>\n<td>脚本刷冷却、多开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>答题类</td>\n<td>题库 + 服务端计时</td>\n<td>强（防重复作答）</td>\n<td>题库泄露、抓包重放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轻竞技/排行榜</td>\n<td>ZSET 分数</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>刷分、分数伪造</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收集类（集卡）</td>\n<td>卡片集合</td>\n<td>强（防重复发卡）</td>\n<td>概率操纵、交易套利</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"概率公示-合规要求带来的工程约束\">概率公示：合规要求带来的工程约束</h2><p>多个市场对抽奖类活动有概率公示的硬性要求（日本、韩国以及欧盟部分国家的消费者保护法规是常被引用的例子，具体条款以当地最新法规为准）。以日本为例，其《不当景品类及不当表示防止法》（景品表示法，1962 年第 134 号法律）由消费者厅执行，既规制虚假/误导性表示，也限制为吸引顾客而提供的过大景品类（来源：日本消费者厅 景品表示法, <a href=\"https://www.caa.go.jp/policies/policy/representation/fair_labeling/）。这个要求看似只是「在页面上显示一段文字」，实则带来三个工程约束。\">https://www.caa.go.jp/policies/policy/representation/fair_labeling/）。这个要求看似只是「在页面上显示一段文字」，实则带来三个工程约束。</a></p>\n<p>第一，<strong>公示概率必须由奖池配置自动生成</strong>，不能是运营手写的文案——手写的内容一定会与运行时的配置漂移。第二，<strong>当权重因库存耗尽而重新归一化时，公示概率必须同步更新</strong>，这意味着公示页面读取的是与抽奖同一个概率计算函数的输出，而不是一份静态快照。第三，<strong>公示概率必须可追溯</strong>：如果用户投诉「公示说 5% 但我抽了 100 次没中」，系统需要能证明在某一天该奖奖品的实际概率是多少，这要求奖池配置的每次变更都留有版本记录。</p>\n<p>第三点在实践中常被忽视，直到第一次合规审查。做法与任务定义一样：奖池的每次变更生成一个不可变版本，中奖记录上绑定当时的奖池版本号，这样任意一条历史中奖记录都能被还原到它当时遵循的概率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>奖池必须建模成<strong>有限库存</strong>，抽奖的核心原子操作是「判定中奖 + 扣减库存」；库存耗尽时权重必须<strong>重新归一化</strong>而不是归零。</li>\n<li>保底是一个<strong>独立的前置判定层</strong>，其状态（连续未中奖次数）必须原子更新，否则会重复触发。</li>\n<li><strong>抽奖与发奖必须分离</strong>：同步保证资格与结果，异步保证交付，失败进入待补发清单。</li>\n<li>互动小游戏的三条共性：状态与节奏在服务端、收益落到统一奖励目录、排行榜是允许最终一致的独立一致性域，结算必须基于冻结快照。</li>\n<li>概率公示的工程含义是<strong>公示与执行同源</strong>（同一个概率函数）、<strong>库存变化时同步更新</strong>、以及<strong>每次配置变更留不可变版本</strong>以便追溯。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>所有玩法最终都要把奖励真正交付出去，而交付是所有环节里唯一会直接造成资损的一步——见 <a href=\"reward-grant-rule\">玩法奖励发放规则与库存</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"抽奖与互动小游戏接入","id":"抽奖与互动小游戏接入"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：奖池是有限资源，抽奖是一次原子递减","id":"核心概念-奖池是有限资源-抽奖是一次原子递减"},{"level":2,"text":"保底机制：一个独立的判定层","id":"保底机制-一个独立的判定层"},{"level":2,"text":"抽奖与发奖的分离","id":"抽奖与发奖的分离"},{"level":2,"text":"互动小游戏的接入形态","id":"互动小游戏的接入形态"},{"level":2,"text":"概率公示：合规要求带来的工程约束","id":"概率公示-合规要求带来的工程约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"经验值与等级成长路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/loyalty-gamification-growth/growth-level/exp-growth-system"},"next":{"title":"玩法奖励发放规则与库存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/loyalty-gamification-growth/growth-level/reward-grant-rule"}}